content.text:
Yes, the comment is valid. In `handleSubmit`, both mutations fire independently:

```tsx
if (formattedObservations.length > 0) {
  upsertObservations({ observations: formattedObservations });
}
updateDiagnosticReport({ ... });
```

`updateDiagnosticReport` runs regardless of whether `upsertObservations` succeeded, so a failed observation upsert still leaves the report updated with stale observations. Chaining is the right fix. Let me apply it:

